   "text": "Warsaw University of Business - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nWarsaw University of Business\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nThe Warsaw University of Business is a non-public university that has been active in the educational market for several years. The Warsaw University of Business was founded in 2001 and has since enjoyed unwavering interest of students, by offering a rich and comprehensive course of study in the fields of management and logistics. At the Warsaw University of Business education has a practical nature and most of the activities take the form of classes and workshops. Management Studies prepare the students to manage their own companies, lead teams of employees and occupy managerial roles in domestic and international companies. Logistics students learn about the practical functioning aspects of logistics in enterprises, laying foundations for development of their future careers in transport and forwarding companies.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n26/03/2026 10:00\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n26/03/2026 10:00\nby Eston Dalmeida\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nPoland\nYearly Fees\nMax: €3,800.00\nMin: €1,650.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n60%\n1,500 of 2,500 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPrivate\nProvider\nDirect QS\nFounded Year\n2001\nCampus(es)\nWarsaw\nCountry\nPoland\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n14/03/2023\nContract End Date\n01/01/2036\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\n-\nScholarship Offered\nhttps://wwsb.edu.pl/en/student-financial-support/\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZmPmGgOrq7E\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\nApplication Fee - Entry fee € 100",
